isher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Foes Who Make Us","series":"Magic Story","authors":[],"date":"2022-02-09","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09#:~:text=Almost%20imperceptibly%2C%20the%20commander,against%20her%20armored%20leg.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Foes Who Make Us\". Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 9 Feb 2022."}},{"id":"foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09-e8","era":null,"summary":"Norika dismisses the enforcers, frees the prisoners and proposes an opportunity to fix the food crisis.","participants":["norika-yamazaki","heiko-yamazaki","chiye"],"location":"sokenzanshi","importance":"minor","page":"stories/foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09","order":781,"story_date":"2022-02-09","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":105,"quote":"\"I'm here to fix this.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09#:~:text=%22I%27m%20here%20to%20fix%20this.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Foes Who Make Us","series":"Magic Story","authors":[],"date":"2022-02-09","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09#:~:text=%22I%27m%20here%20to%20fix%20this.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Foes Who Make Us\". Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 9 Feb 2022."}},{"id":"foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09-e9","era":null,"summary":"Heiko confesses she loves Chiye as she sends them to warn Risona.","participants":["heiko-yamazaki","chiye"],"location":"sokenzanshi","importance":"minor","page":"stories/foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09","order":781,"story_date":"2022-02-09","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":125,"quote":"\"I love you, now get out of here .","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09#:~:text=%22I%20love%20you%2C%20now,out%20of%20here%20.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Foes Who Make Us","series":"Magic Story","authors":[],"date":"2022-02-09","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09#:~:text=%22I%20love%20you%2C%20now,out%20of%20here%20.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Foes Who Make Us\". Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 9 Feb 2022."}},{"id":"foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09-e10","era":null,"summary":"Heiko and Norika fight on the tracks and Norika reveals she came to forgive her.","participants":["norika-yamazaki","heiko-yamazaki"],"location":"sokenzanshi","importance":"major","page":"stories/foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09","order":781,"story_date":"2022-02-09","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":143,"quote":"\"I didn't come here to make you pay. I came here to forgive you.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09#:~:text=%22I%20didn%27t%20come%20here,here%20to%20forgive%20you.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Foes Who Make Us","series":"Magic Story","authors":[],"date":"2022-02-09","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09#:~:text=%22I%20didn%27t%20come%20here,here%20to%20forgive%20you.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Foes Who Make Us\". Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 9 Feb 2022."}},{"id":"foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09-e11","era":null,"summary":"Heiko shows Norika the Uprisers' charity work as she pretends to be Norika's prisoner.","participants":["heiko-yamazaki","norika-yamazaki","asari-uprisers"],"location":"sokenzanshi","importance":"minor","page":"stories/foes-who-make-us-2022-02-09"